{"slug": "fantastic-yellowstone-05a1135b", "synopsis": "*Fantastic Yellowstone* traces the origins of the national park idea at Yellowstone, established as a pioneering \u201cmother park\u201d for the world. It examines early damage from hunting, tourism, development, and souvenir collecting, then considers the continuing tension between wildlife habitat and human needs. The film concludes by presenting parks, refuges, and wilderness as foundations of conservation.", "clips": [{"id": "edfd75b4-e1e1-5745-bead-f57393af807e", "sourceSlug": "fantastic-yellowstone-05a1135b", "sourceTitle": "Fantastic Yellowstone", "sourceYear": 1997, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 9.643, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/05a1135b-c8a4-5a2e-946d-8620b3d9da11/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/edfd75b4-e1e1-5745-bead-f57393af807e.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/05a1135b-c8a4-5a2e-946d-8620b3d9da11/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/edfd75b4-e1e1-5745-bead-f57393af807e.jpg"}, {"id": "fdf130ac-7ce2-5fa2-b1bb-8c7f5ef74ccb", "sourceSlug": "fantastic-yellowstone-05a1135b", "sourceTitle": "Fantastic Yellowstone", "sourceYear": 1997, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 9.643, "endSeconds": 59.643, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/05a1135b-c8a4-5a2e-946d-8620b3d9da11/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/fdf130ac-7ce2-5fa2-b1bb-8c7f5ef74ccb.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/05a1135b-c8a4-5a2e-946d-8620b3d9da11/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/thumbnails/fdf130ac-7ce2-5fa2-b1bb-8c7f5ef74ccb.jpg"}, {"id": "f095006e-ffb9-5967-9585-e502fd3b7b7f", "sourceSlug": "fantastic-yellowstone-05a1135b", "sourceTitle": "Fantastic Yellowstone", "sourceYear": 1997, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 59.643, "endSeconds": 104.643, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/05a1135b-c8a4-5a2e-946d-8620b3d9da11/v5-windowed-cl